# Git LFS is prepared but NOT yet activated on purpose:
# marking already-tracked normal files as LFS makes them appear modified
# and `git lfs migrate import` requires a clean working tree.
#
# After committing current work, activate with:
#   1. git lfs migrate import --no-rewrite -- mp4 mp3 wav webm
#      (converts existing tracked media to LFS pointers, no history rewrite)
#   2. uncomment the patterns below
#   3. git add .gitattributes && git commit -m "chore: enable git lfs for media"
#   4. push (LFS objects upload automatically; GitHub free quota is 1 GB storage)
#
# *.mp4 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.mp3 filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.wav filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.webm filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.jpg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.jpeg filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.png filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
# *.webp filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
